Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,“I'll just {\c&H1EB0F2&}move{\c&HFAF7F5&} my stop\Na little.” Here's what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:04.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,that does.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:08.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,You planned to risk\N{\c&H1EB0F2&}fifty{\c&HFAF7F5&} dollars. The trade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:11.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,goes against you. You\Nmove the stop. Now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:14.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,you're risking a\N{\c&H1EB0F2&}hundred.{\c&HFAF7F5&} Then a {\c&H1EB0F2&}hundred{\c&HFAF7F5&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:14.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,and {\c&H1EB0F2&}fifty.{\c&HFAF7F5&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:18.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's {\c&H1EB0F2&}three{\c&HFAF7F5&} times your\Nplan. And your journal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:20.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,still says you had a\Nstop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:24.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Moving a stop further\Naway isn't managing the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:27.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,trade. It's {\c&H1EB0F2&}changing{\c&HFAF7F5&} the\Nplan after the plan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:28.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,stopped working.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:32.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,If you do it, tag it.\N{\c&H1EB0F2&}Moved{\c&HFAF7F5&} stop. Then check
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,what it cost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:37.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Be {\c&H1EB0F2&}honest{\c&HFAF7F5&} in the\Ncomments. Have you ever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:38.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,moved a stop?
